Run 1 (`path pf`): the directory `packages/<hash>` on stdout, one line (R-PTH1). The call list has the one read of the project file and the packages listing (`Present`), no other read: the run reads and runs no file of the package (R-PTH5). The project is recorded in `projects.json` (R-PTH4, R-PD9).
Run 2 (`path json --offline`, the package is missing): exit 15, no download (R-PTH2, R-FE7). Run 3 (`path json`): the fetch of the closure step: download, `roc unbundle`, rename (R-FE2, R-FE3). The package is in the tree afterwards, stdout is its directory, and no project file changes (R-PTH2: nothing is resolved, nothing is written).
